<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Encryptid Offline Finals &mdash; Level</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
  <script src="/index.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Part 1/4: encryptid{shy4mp -->
  <div class="card">
    <h1>Greetings, hunter.</h1>
    <p>To get through my life story, you first need to go through my safe.</p>
    <p class="hint">I have split the passcode of my safe into different parts. Find them on this website and enter the passcode below.</p>
    <form method="POST" action="/submit">
      <input type="text" name="flag" placeholder="encryptid{...}" autocomplete="off">
      <button type="submit">Submit flag</button>
    </form>
    <% if (typeof correct !== 'undefined') { %>
      <% if (correct) { %>
        <p class="good">Correct! Now say this to the hunt masters exactly, word by word, and follow their instructions after doing so:</p>
        <blockquote>Chandu ke chaacha ne chandu ki chaachi ko chaandni raat me chaandni chowk me chandi ke chammach se chutney chatai</blockquote>
      <% } else { %>
        <p class="error">Nope. Keep digging.</p>
      <% } %>
    <% } %>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
